  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Development through social models - Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Train families in food security and nutrition, basic sanitation and best productive practices, and assist them in formulating plans to improve their livelihoods though non-farm activities. Capacity building on Food Security, Nutrition, Basic Sanitation, and Best Productive Practices on sustainable and climate resilient agriculture techiniques. Work with the families and local organisations to create the skills to develop sustainable and competitive investment profiles that are profitable and generate surpluses. These will be invested in having adequate food in quantity and quality, education, health, home infrastructure, and improvement of living conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
